{"id":43095,"ord":134,"n_segments":151,"prev":43094,"next":43096,"doc":{"id":"52157","title":"52157_Count Basie oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Count Basie","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/52157/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=52157"},"chapter":"Carnegie Hall, nicknames and later career","title":"Films with the Basie band","category":"later_career","summary":"Kuehl goes through a film list; Basie remembers some, doubts others, and says he did a film because he was hired to.","period":"1940s-60s","year_from":1940,"year_to":2009,"words":396,"start":[224,4],"end":[227,7],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=52157#s43095","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[{"name":"Stage Door Canteen","focus":0,"city":null},{"name":"Savoy Ballroom","focus":0,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Count Basie Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Count Basie"}]},"people":[{"name":"Top Man","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Count Basie","qid":"Q107008","n":1},{"name":"Sarah Vaughan","qid":"Q229513","n":1},{"name":"John Chilton","qid":"Q426431","n":1},{"name":"Donald O'Connor","qid":"Q348345","n":1},{"name":"Beverly","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Man of the Family","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":29,"theme_name":"Jazz musicians in the movies and film scoring","community":55,"community_name":"Jazz musicians on film and studio scoring","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":224,"b":4,"s":"MS.","x":"All right. Let me ask you this. You did a bunch of films; right?"},{"p":224,"b":5,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Not a bunch, no. Not a bunch."},{"p":224,"b":6,"s":"MS.","x":"No?"},{"p":224,"b":7,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"No, not a bunch."},{"p":224,"b":8,"s":"MS.","x":"\"Top Man?\" Do you remember that?"},{"p":224,"b":9,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Was it Top Man?"},{"p":224,"b":10,"s":"MS.","x":"I don't know. Was it?"},{"p":224,"b":11,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"There was a Man in there. It sounds like it."},{"p":224,"b":12,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah?"},{"p":224,"b":13,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Who was that with?"},{"p":224,"b":14,"s":"MS.","x":"I don't know. (Unintelligible)"},{"p":224,"b":15,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Yeah, I think that was with Donald O'Connor."},{"p":224,"b":16,"s":"MS.","x":"Do you remember what you played?"},{"p":224,"b":17,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Sure."},{"p":224,"b":18,"s":"MS.","x":"What?"},{"p":225,"b":0,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Something."},{"p":225,"b":1,"s":"MS.","x":": What?"},{"p":225,"b":2,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"I played something."},{"p":225,"b":3,"s":"MS.","x":": Oh, something."},{"p":225,"b":4,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"That's not the title, though. (Unintelligible)"},{"p":225,"b":5,"s":"MS.","x":": Right. \"Choo-Choo Swing?\" Do you remember Choo-Choo Swing?"},{"p":225,"b":6,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Oh, who did that?"},{"p":225,"b":7,"s":"MS.","x":": I don't know."},{"p":225,"b":8,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Was that a record?"},{"p":225,"b":9,"s":"MS.","x":": It says a film. \"Films showing the Basie band include Top Man, Choo-Choo-Swing.\""},{"p":225,"b":10,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"It escapes me."},{"p":225,"b":11,"s":"MS.","x":": \"Reveille with Beverly.\""},{"p":225,"b":12,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":225,"b":13,"s":"MS.","x":": Remember that?"},{"p":225,"b":14,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":225,"b":15,"s":"MS.","x":": You did that; huh? \"Stage Door Canteen?\" (Unintelligible)"},{"p":225,"b":16,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"We did that? (Unintelligible)"},{"p":225,"b":17,"s":"MS.","x":": I don't know."},{"p":225,"b":18,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"We must have. I guess (Unintelligible) that must run through out there with [Sarah]; a lot of people have been (unintelligible) made those things (inaudible)"},{"p":225,"b":19,"s":"MS.","x":": \"Hit Parade of 1943.\""},{"p":225,"b":20,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"(Unintelligible)"},{"p":225,"b":21,"s":"MS.","x":": Uh-huh."},{"p":226,"b":0,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"(Unintelligible)"},{"p":226,"b":1,"s":"MS.","x":": Made in Paris."},{"p":226,"b":2,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Oh, no."},{"p":226,"b":3,"s":"MS.","x":": No?"},{"p":226,"b":4,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Where did they get that at?"},{"p":226,"b":5,"s":"MS.","x":": I don't know. It's Chilton's Who's Who. \"Cinderfella?\" \"Sex and the Single Girl.\" Now, why would you do a movie like that?"},{"p":226,"b":6,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Because I was hired to."},{"p":226,"b":7,"s":"MS.","x":": \"Jamboree?\""},{"p":226,"b":8,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"(Unintelligible)"},{"p":226,"b":9,"s":"MS.","x":": You did Jamboree?"},{"p":226,"b":10,"s":"","x":"I don't think I did that."},{"p":226,"b":11,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"(Unintelligible)"},{"p":226,"b":12,"s":"MS.","x":": Didn't do that? \"One More Time?\" Huh?"},{"p":226,"b":13,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"No."},{"p":226,"b":14,"s":"MS.","x":": No? \"Man of the Family.\""},{"p":226,"b":15,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Who?"},{"p":226,"b":16,"s":"MS.","x":": That's what it says."},{"p":226,"b":17,"s":"","x":"Where'd they get that?"},{"p":226,"b":18,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"(Unintelligible)"},{"p":226,"b":19,"s":"MS.","x":": I don't know, Bill."},{"p":226,"b":20,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"They must have just put me in it."},{"p":226,"b":21,"s":"MS.","x":": I see. You mean it's possible that you were put it some of these films."},{"p":226,"b":22,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":226,"b":23,"s":"MS.","x":": You didn't do them, so it is possible"},{"p":227,"b":0,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"(Unintelligible) someone else."},{"p":227,"b":1,"s":"MS.","x":"Right."},{"p":227,"b":2,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"I mean sometimes some things are being aired that we played in the Savoy or something like that with -- and I don't even remember that, (unintelligible) that were doing with lady."},{"p":227,"b":3,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah. That's funny because that's the one he doesn't have down here. \"Symphony In\" -- what was that called? Not Symphony in Black. Yes; Symphony in Black?\" (Unintelligible)"},{"p":227,"b":4,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"What?"},{"p":227,"b":5,"s":"MS.","x":"I don't remember. At any rate, it's not down here."},{"p":227,"b":6,"s":"MR. BASIE","x":"No."},{"p":227,"b":7,"s":"MS.","x":"The one you did (unintelligible) with her was really good."}]}